{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10085","headline":"尚书宗兄使过诗以奉献 · 包佶","name":"尚书宗兄使过诗以奉献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛下交亲满，归闲意有余。\n翻嫌旧坐宅，却驾所悬车。\n腹饱山僧供，头轻侍婢梳。\n上官唯揖让，半禄代耕鉏。\n雨散三秋别，风传一字书。\n胜游如可继，还欲并园庐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包佶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10085.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10085","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}